      "challenges": [
        "2,340 alerts; 2,084 verified (89.1%), 355 validated suspects, 338 investigated (95.2%), and 172 transferred. Six provinces have numeric alert rows (Haut-Uele, Bas-Uele, Ituri, Nord-Kivu, Sud-Ubangi and Tshopo); Sud-Kivu is unavailable, not zero.",
